---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro"
import { SITE } from "../site"

const mail = `mailto:${SITE.email}`
---

<Base title="Privacy">
  <h1>Privacy</h1>
  <div class="prose">
    <p>
      Responsible in accordance with the data protection laws:<br />
      Martin Lechner<br />
      Klosterstrasse 6d<br />
      82284 Grafrath, Germany
    </p>

    <h2>General information</h2>
    <p>
      As the operator of lechner.work it is important to me that you know exactly
      which personal data is collected on this website, how it is processed, and
      how you can influence it. In particular, I would like to stress that I have
      no interest in your data. These will only be collected and stored for
      technical reasons. In doing so, I adhere to the principle of data
      minimization.
    </p>

    <h2>Hosting and access log</h2>
    <p>
      lechner.work is currently delivered by Netlify. The terms of
      <a href="https://www.netlify.com/gdpr-ccpa/">Netlify's stance on GDPR</a>
      apply. I have no access to any data (e.g. access logs) the hoster might
      collect.
    </p>

    <h2>Encryption</h2>
    <p>
      All data transferred between the web server and your browser is encrypted
      using TLS.
    </p>

    <h2>Cookies</h2>
    <p>
      This website does not set any cookies. All fonts and assets are served from
      lechner.work itself.
    </p>

    <h2>Statistics and tracking</h2>
    <p>
      There is no tracking, analytics or fingerprinting on this website. It does
      not interest me who you are and where you come from.
    </p>

    <h2>External links</h2>
    <p>
      Blog posts link to content on other websites, for example videos. Once you
      follow such a link, the privacy policy of that website applies.
    </p>

    <h2>Information, correction and deletion</h2>
    <p>
      You have the right to receive information about your personal data stored
      by me at any time. You also have the right to have your personal data or
      parts thereof corrected or deleted. To do so, send an email to
      <a href={mail}>{SITE.email}</a>. Please note that when you send this email,
      personal data will be stored in my mail account (see next section).
    </p>

    <h2>Email</h2>
    <p>
      If you contact me by email at <a href={mail}>{SITE.email}</a>, I will store
      all the information you send me. I do this in order to be able to react
      appropriately to your contacting me. I keep direct emails to me permanently
      in my email account, which is hosted by Proton in Switzerland.
    </p>

    <h2>Modification of the data protection declaration</h2>
    <p>
      I reserve the right to update this privacy policy to comply with current
      legal requirements or to explain changes to my infrastructure. Your renewed
      visit will then be subject to the new privacy policy.
    </p>

    <h2>Questions about data protection</h2>
    <p>
      If you have any questions about data protection, please send an email to
      <a href={mail}>{SITE.email}</a>.
    </p>
  </div>
</Base>
